{
  "_comment": "Which rect of which source sheet becomes which asset. Every PNG under assets/ (outside _source/) must appear here as an 'out' -- tools/check_palette.gd enforces it, so art cannot be added by hand. 'source' is relative to assets/_source/; 'out' is relative to the project root. 'transparent' is a source colour cut to alpha 0 before quantizing, for sources with no alpha channel. 'erase' is a list of [x, y, w, h] rects in slice-local coordinates cut to alpha 0, for furniture the source draws inside the frame; each needs an 'erase_why'.",
